OL,3,GNEWSA'Much-loved' tapir dies following
OL,4,Ashort illness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tapir at Curraghs Wildlife Park has
OL,7,Fdied after a short illness.
OL,9,FThe 'much-loved' animal, called Zeus,
OL,10,Fwas born on the Isle of Man 11 years
OL,11,Fago and was the only male tapir at the
OL,12,Fpark.
OL,14,FPark manager Kathleen Graham said the
OL,15,Fanimal, which died of colic, was
OL,16,Fpopular among visitors and will be
OL,17,Fmissed.
OL,19,F"Losing an animal is always difficult,
OL,20,Fboth for the people who care for them
OL,21,Fand for those who have come to know
OL,22,Fthem during visits," she said.
